## Game Rules 📋

### **Basic Rules:**
1. **X goes first** (always)
2. Players take turns placing their mark
3. **Only one mark per square**
4. Game ends when someone wins or board fills up
5. If all 9 squares are filled with no winner → **Draw!**

### **What Happens When:**
| Situation | Result | Visual Feedback |
|-----------|--------|------------------|
| You win 🎉 | "Player X wins!" | Winning line glows green |
| Draw game 🤝 | "It's a draw!" | No winner announced |
| Click filled square | Nothing happens | Move ignored |
| Game ends | No more moves allowed | Board disabled |

