## Keyboard Controls ⌨️

While the game is mouse/click based, you can also:
- **Click** - Make a move
- **Tab** - Navigate through cells
- **Enter/Space** - Select highlighted cell
- **Click "New Game"** - Reset the board

## Mobile Play 📱

On touch devices:
- **Tap** any empty cell to place your mark
- **Tap "New Game"** to restart
- Game automatically adapts to your screen size

## Common Questions ❓

### **Q: Who goes first?**
A: X always starts the game.

### **Q: Can I change my move?**
A: No, moves are permanent. Plan carefully!

### **Q: How do I know it's my turn?**
A: Look at the purple badge showing "X's Turn" or "O's Turn"

### **Q: What happens if I click a filled square?**
A: Nothing - the game ignores invalid moves.

### **Q: Can I play again?**
A: Yes! Click the "New Game 🔄" button anytime.

### **Q: Is there a time limit?**
A: No, take your time thinking about moves.

